{"format_version":2,"id":"18c322272c8ea433822da79762834bdc9b59a9b1b4b263bb","commits":["57b8681e0d0915e44ea1b7dba6ee84e56f4d6e22"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**Publish gate marker read is now retried.** The gate retries reading the `rlsbl-ci-sha` marker from the GitHub Release body (5 attempts, 5s apart) before falling back to $GITHUB_SHA, so GitHub API read-replica lag on a freshly created release no longer causes the gate to poll the wrong commit and time out.","type":"fix"}
